innesota.","date":"2026-10-28"}],"media":[{"who":"Laura Ingraham","what":"Called DSA member Angie Nixon's Democratic Senate primary win the best midterm news for the GOP since Platner.","when":"2026-08-20","lean":"R"},{"who":"Charlamagne tha God","what":"Gave Laura Loomer Donkey of the Day on The Breakfast Club over her attacks on Democratic Senate nominee Angie Nixon.","when":"2026-08-31","lean":"other"},{"who":"Nathan Gonzales","what":"Inside Elections moved the Florida Senate race for Ashley Moody's seat from Solid Republican to Likely Republican.","when":"2026-10-20","lean":"nonpartisan"}],"donorSignal":{"z":0.283,"parts":{"instate":0.309,"breadth":0.256},"shift_logit":0.0,"applies":false},"research":{"summary":"Appointed Republican Sen. Ashley Moody faces Democratic state Rep. Angie Nixon of Jacksonville in the special election for the rest of Marco Rubio's term, with a Stetson poll showing Moody holding a double digit lead in a state where Republicans have about 1.5 million more registered voters. Moody casts Nixon as a socialist who is soft on crime, while Nixon, who outraised Moody last quarter, attacks Moody over the Hope Florida settlement and health care cuts.","issues":[{"issue":"Hope Florida settlement","why":"Democrats say Moody's office approved a Medicaid settlement that routed 10 million dollars to political committees, while Moody has not been charged and denies wrongdoing.","src":"https://www.wusf.org/politics-issues/2026-10-01/democrats-slam-ashley-moody-amid-heated-us-senate-race"},{"issue":"Crime and policing","why":"Moody runs on her record as a judge and attorney general and says Nixon quotes cop killers, which Nixon disputes.","src":"https://floridianpress.com/2026/10/ashley-moody-puts-tough-on-crime-resume-against-angie-nixons-radical-approach/"},{"issue":"Socialism label","why":"Nixon joined the Democratic Socialists of America in June but calls herself a capitalist who supports regulation, while Moody frames the race as freedom versus socialism.","src":"https://flvoicenews.com/trump-send-ashley-moody-back-to-the-senate-defeat-communist-angie-nixon/"},{"issue":"Cost of living and student debt","why":"Nixon focuses on rising costs, student debt and low paying jobs for graduates.","src":"https://www.wuft.org/politics/2026-10-19/bernie-sanders-and-angie-nixon-rally-thousands-at-uf-encouraging-young-voters-to-head-to-polls"},{"issue":"Health coverage","why":"Nixon says Moody voted to end health care for over 440,000 Floridians.","src":"https://www.foxnews.com/media/florida-senate-candidate-angie-nixon-calls-jailing-gop-opponent-ashley-moody"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Sanders rallies thousands with Nixon at UF","date":"2026-10-18","what":"Bernie Sanders and Nixon drew more than 2,800 people in Gainesville, urging young voters to turn out on costs and student debt.","helps":"D","kind":"rally","src":"https://www.wuft.org/politics/2026-10-19/bernie-sanders-and-angie-nixon-rally-thousands-at-uf-encouraging-young-voters-to-head-to-polls"},{"title":"Nixon outraises Moody","date":"2026-10-17","what":"Nixon raised about 2 million dollars more than Moody in the third quarter on a jump in small donors, but still has less cash on hand.","helps":"D","kind":"local","src":"https://www.tampabay.com/news/florida-politics/elections/2026/10/17/nixon-moody-senate-campaign-donors/"},{"title":"Nixon says Moody should be jailed","date":"2026-10-14","what":"In a TV interview Nixon said she wants Moody locked up over Hope Florida and would seek an investigation. Moody's campaign called it a tactic from the communist playbook.","helps":"R","kind":"attack","src":"https://www.foxnews.com/media/florida-senate-candidate-angie-nixon-calls-jailing-gop-opponent-ashley-moody"},{"title":"Moody ad touts tough on crime record","date":"2026-10-14","what":"A Moody ad says she spent her career putting criminals behind bars and that her opponent quotes cop killers, citing Nixon's past praise of Assata Shakur.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"htt